{"id":"639803","name":"柚子炒饭","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/639803/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"2杯"},{"name":"柚子","amount":"1/4个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"一把"},{"name":"青豆","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"一把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有材料。","img":"images/639803/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"柚子掰成小颗粒，也不要太小。","img":"images/639803/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"玉米青豆焯水备用。","img":"images/639803/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将鸡蛋打入碗中，搅散备用。","img":"images/639803/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内加入适量食用油，倒入鸡蛋液煎熟。","img":"images/639803/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入火腿丁。","img":"images/639803/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入玉米青豆。","img":"images/639803/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入虾皮。","img":"images/639803/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入米饭，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/639803/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入一勺白糖。","img":"images/639803/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入一勺食盐。","img":"images/639803/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入一勺生抽搅拌均匀。","img":"images/639803/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入柚子粒。","img":"images/639803/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒均匀就可以了。","img":"images/639803/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"开动啦。","img":"images/639803/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}